{"unit_id":"Adkid-Zephyr__Liltloom#card-zh","repo":"Adkid-Zephyr/Liltloom","commit":"514f853c8f072d892aee59b12f54b8ee56f5a6c5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Liltloom（语织）是 DSH Web 的个人写作风格记忆插件：它在后台观察合格的用户表达，提取结构化偏好并保存到持久化存储。你可以通过设置页或命令查看、编辑、锁定和删除规则，预览风格上下文，并在需要时显式激活；还支持导入导出、可选原文片段和受限模型分析。适合希望 AI 按个人习惯写作、同时保留对记忆内容和使用时机控制的人。需要提供 storage-domain 的 DSH Web profile；模型分析需另行配置路线。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/service.ts:1","cordis.patch.yml:1-3","src/client/index.tsx:36-54"]}
{"unit_id":"Adkid-Zephyr__Liltloom#card-en","repo":"Adkid-Zephyr/Liltloom","commit":"514f853c8f072d892aee59b12f54b8ee56f5a6c5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Liltloom is a writing-style memory plugin for DSH Web. It observes eligible user text and saves preferences. Users can edit rules, preview style context, and activate it for a reply or session. It supports JSON import/export. It needs DSH Web with durable storage.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/service.ts:1","cordis.patch.yml:1-3","src/client/index.tsx:36-54"]}
