{"unit_id":"Adkid-Zephyr__Liltloom#feature-learn","repo":"Adkid-Zephyr/Liltloom","commit":"514f853c8f072d892aee59b12f54b8ee56f5a6c5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**Liltloom** 的功能「静默学习」：插件在会话事件中筛选合格的用户原生表达并提取语言特征，写入结构化记忆；基础观察由配置控制，不会因此自动把风格加入回答。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/service.ts:1","src/features.ts:1"]}
{"unit_id":"Adkid-Zephyr__Liltloom#feature-rules","repo":"Adkid-Zephyr/Liltloom","commit":"514f853c8f072d892aee59b12f54b8ee56f5a6c5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**Liltloom** 的功能「规则维护」：用户可在设置界面搜索、编辑和维护偏好规则，也可通过命令新增、锁定、忽略或删除规则。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/SettingsTab.tsx:78-93","src/command.ts:210-220"]}
{"unit_id":"Adkid-Zephyr__Liltloom#feature-context","repo":"Adkid-Zephyr/Liltloom","commit":"514f853c8f072d892aee59b12f54b8ee56f5a6c5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**Liltloom** 的功能「预览与激活」：用户可按文体预览编译后的 Style Context Packet，再激活到下一次回复或整个会话，并可随时撤下。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:56-94","src/compiler.ts:1"]}
{"unit_id":"Adkid-Zephyr__Liltloom#feature-transfer","repo":"Adkid-Zephyr/Liltloom","commit":"514f853c8f072d892aee59b12f54b8ee56f5a6c5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**Liltloom** 的功能「数据迁移」：命令接口提供可读 JSON 数据导出与导入，导入支持合并或替换；也提供明确确认的个人数据清除操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/command.ts:190-201","src/service.ts:1"]}
